<title>THAILAND: TRIS cancels GSS 's BBB debt rating.</title>
<headline>TRIS cancels GSS 's BBB debt rating.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Rating and Information Services (TRIS) said on Thursday it cancelled its BBB rating for GSS Array Technology Plc's planned one billion baht debentures.</p>
<p>TRIS said in a statement that GSS requested the rating cancellation as the computer circuit boards producer had no plan to float the debenture in the near future.</p>
<p>The rating agency said late last year it might downgrade GSS's rating after its earnings for nine months ending August 30 declined 59 percent from a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-6520642</p>
</text>
